 latitude and longitude coordinates. Input should be a place name like 'Beijing', 'New York', or 'Eiffel Tower'. Returns the coordinates and additional location details. name:geocoding parameters:map[properties:map[location:map[description:The location name to geocode. Must use 'location' as the parameter name. Examples: 'Beijing', 'Times Square', 'Tokyo Tower' type:string]] required:[location] type:object] results:map[description:Geocoding tool to convert a location name into latitude and longitude coordinates properties:map[latitude:map[description:The latitude coordinate of the location example:39.9042 type:string] longitude:map[description:The longitude coordinate of the location example:116.4074 type:string]] type:object]]]
